  "id": "experience-dependent-process",
  "term": "experience-dependent process",
  "definition": "An experience-dependent process is a change that develops through repeated lived experience rather than by learning a skill in the abstract. In this context, it refers to mindfulness working through ongoing, reciprocal practice that gradually readjusts stress-related psychological and bodily regulation.",
